    <string name="section_reliability">Reliability on Android</string>
    <string name="reliability_intro">Android and vendor overlays (for example ColorOS) may limit background work and kill services. To increase the chance of an automatic save:</string>
    <string name="reliability_bullet_background">• allow the app to run in the background without restrictions,</string>
    <string name="reliability_bullet_autostart">• enable autostart for Parked,</string>
    <string name="reliability_bullet_battery">• disable battery optimization for Parked,</string>
    <string name="reliability_bullet_recents">• do not swipe the app away from the recents list.</string>
    <string name="reliability_outro">No app can guarantee a save if the system kills it. If needed, use the manual save button.</string>
